| `make test-ship` `[local]` | Runs pytest, including their `slow` tests, over exactly the renderer modules configured by `tests.ship_set`, read through `scripts/config_get.py`, before full verify in every fix or review round, including doc-only rounds. | `make test-ship` | [`tests.ship_set`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Refuses an empty set; generated projects declare `[]` because renderer meta-tests do not ship. The AST derivation test holds the template list to modules that render a project via Copier APIs, child processes, test helpers or fixtures, and fails unresolved render bindings; this target does not replace full verify. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md) | always |
